Package: m6APrediction
Type: Package
Title: Predict RNA m6A Sites with a Random Forest Model
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zhengtao", "Qi", email = "Zhengtao.Qi24@student.xjtlu.edu.cn",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Zhen", "Wei", role = "ctb",
           comment = "BIO215 teaching model, example data and original prediction functions"))
Description: Provides batch and single-site prediction of RNA N6-methyladenosine
    status using a supplied random forest and seven input features. Includes
    the fitted teaching model, example feature data and documented prediction
    functions for reproducible educational use. Model scores are intended for
    research exploration and do not establish experimental or clinical validity.
